Premises:
(forall x (Book(x) -> Contains(x, knowledge))) AND (forall x forall y (ReadBook(x, y) -> Gains(x, knowledge))) AND (forall x (Gains(x, knowledge) -> Smarter(x))) AND (ReadBook(harry, walden) AND Book(walden))

